ok   many writes at once: the file always parses and holds every account

stale guesses: a reset or change is never locked by wrong passwords made before it
ok   five wrong passwords in flight: the account counts as locked meanwhile
ok   the reset's temporary password signs in while the old guesses are still in flight (ok)
ok   the old guesses get the usual answer, nothing more (bad)
ok   ... and they do not lock the reset account
ok   the fresh temporary password signs in after they finish (ok)
ok   stale guesses still count against their address (the 11th try: throttled)
